id: pm-aksavu
title: Agent-task baselines accept missing task and composite token ceilings
description: "CodeRabbit review on PR #1133 found that undefined or non-finite task and composite max_estimated_tokens values make JavaScript comparisons false, silently disabling mandatory token ratchets. Validate every baseline ceiling before comparison and add negative controls for absent and non-finite values."
